  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "01eaa5a1-38ca-4f9b-886f-2bb10c6a23d1",
      "title": "Escute e leia a frase. Observe como o convite já inclui um contexto bem cotidiano.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "4d7d1962-f89b-47fd-9e0e-47c3cc88b83c",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute a linha e acompanhe a tradução.</p><p><strong>¿Quieres tomar algo después del trabajo?</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Você quer tomar alguma coisa depois do trabalho?</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/cc67a3ebddee443b86535e5e10f9f7a0_l02b01-after-work-invitation.png?Expires=1794099535&Signature=fMXHSCCL4ICWylpmOW5ZD6vbMQiyD~pnDJEFGDuLvcWqAlfEpBFdFxH19To-v3GNFnEQ16cpDwCzmIzPjQpei8P~GLkEFRmtPFSUTJ1HUMkpU08sufpA3DJrmgBfpUG5TmCt37JKTHjgjAVBgO0Mo1SzPf3gE5hITvjVDaa4wh5JNG60q4vEyZeLdtjDYtsKPpm2GKLSqVqn7JA2lJ4fBW2L98yLJTXf7bfE6zJ5RDGm87ge3E3nkX2P1WkcIpGoKVjxL4jFuwLjAUL~kPlmAQC~bj92t23IFN8fCFALP7sjn~OFkhpLL7n3TsCxEXHhYQRjG~d5O6DWU4-b2sEy-w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6445f4aff2a942d68590751f03e59028_l02b01-quieres-tomar-algo-despues-del-trabajo.mp3?Expires=1794099535&Signature=e4ZlourTvfgsgp6aioYUjtLIbbZTy2RgEopMCIl1-LLbqbQ3148wago3fRKnoPePtiFY6mYYfuuQlXBGrIOvH2GO68BaOJ9IAny1qVayrpRC7L1evyD2ubH6RepDRWEjVgmEc-9-yBHwF3kQPw1R4SyBI3noNGvT463-o18fxcKIsfohojMi9HNN0jgWfTLQ0NZPHmtjU5qGCDLK5-thc12ys~XNgzu4RQ6b0LNeViF3bOwopFTrXAhjDhuhYBUKDCoBdyqBQn2iVpDGkhumxmV3pmVk-SxlXYnqx9QUndWQftwGh7WadpUSwwFanElptHyqhHLnhO3ibdoAQhoRng__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
